	quest.773EFC795A3B8AFF.quest_desc: [
		"Hello {Player} And welcome to Antarchy Craft."
		"This chapter walks you through your first days: wood, stone, food, iron, diamonds and the road to the Nether."
		"Around the edge of this page are doorways to every other chapter in the book. Each one lights up when you finish the quest it hangs from, so the further you get here, the more of the pack opens up."
	]
